# presentation_route.kufscript without its freezes (the game-state comparisons: state_compare.py; a freeze needs
# render-only frames, which the 30 fps reference does not have).
500 tap Return
700 press Return
850 press Return
1000 press Down
1100 press Return
1300 repeat 60 until gameplay press Return
@gameplay+300 log mark start
@gameplay+300 capture start
@gameplay+300 down W
@gameplay+320 log mark walk
@gameplay+379 log mark walk_end
@gameplay+380 up W
